  "description": "The certification fleet (ADR-0031, ADR-0081). `projects` and `inventory` are the discovery inventory: every Nx project tagged layer:certification that runs the shared semantic conformance engine (tools/conformance/harness/run.ts), each with the adapter manifest its conformance target drives and its truthful raw status, which must equal the status in its checked-in compatibility evidence. `certified` lists the project and profile pairs that must certify; only inventory projects in state pass may appear, and the harness fails a certified run that selects zero applicable checks. Until certification profiles exist, a certified entry's profile is its adapter manifest's suiteId. tools/conformance/certification/validate-certification-discovery.ts machine-diffs the inventory both directions against tag-based discovery and hard-fails on any divergence. The `conformance` lane runs every inventory project.",
